d not disappoint. They are take-out only but I didn't have to wait long for my order and it was easy to grab and go. The iced ginger chai was so delicious!!! I ordered the shrimp kaathi roll which was so good! My son ordered the crab & aloo kofta. Although it was good, he liked my dish better. The naan was just ok, and my son commented that it was over-seasoned. For dessert, I ordered the mini mango pie. I liked it. Don't let the small portion discourage you, it was plenty to satisfy. My son ordered the rava laddu and he didn't care for it due to gritty texture. I thought the flavors were nice but very sweet and the texture was l..."},{"business_id":"nsFrC9EYtV-0TazHOyMSUw","review_id":"0_UKDVlSnxIe0njJIBZ27w","date":"2020-10-09T00:41:15","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9145333170890808,"text_excerpt":"Everyone needs to get here. Their food is excellent. I had the best chana masala of my life here. They also use greens instead of spinach in their saag, which is brilliant and gives a good bite to the dish. We are so lucky to have this place in our city. I will be back to try more!"}],"visual":[]},"notebook_case":null}
